+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// Stored login (steward design step 19.1, section 7.2.1)
+//
+// An accepted login is written to disk encrypted with AES-256-GCM under a
+// 32-byte key the operator supplies by path, so a fresh bridge process can
+// resume it instead of asking for another QR scan. Every answer here is typed:
+// a store that is switched off, unreadable or throttled never becomes a panic,
+// and a read that fails never deletes the file it could not read.
+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
